272   4214              ; under: C = the top line of a row of cells -> NZ if a ledge's cell is in
273   4214              ;        that row under the runner's 16 pixels: two cells, or three when x
274   4214              ;        is not a multiple of 8; ledges, the cartridge's map of the cells,
275   4214              ;        holds 1 for a ledge's. Uses A, B, DE
